---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { company } from '../data/site';
import { websiteOffer as W } from '../data/pricing';
---
<Base title="Terms and Conditions" description="Terms of use for the Amica Digital Services website.">
  <PageHero title="Terms and Conditions" lead="Last updated: 6 November 2026" crumbs={[{ label: 'Terms and Conditions' }]} />
  <section class="section-sm">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>About these terms</h2>
      <p>These terms cover your use of this website, operated by {company.legalName}. Services we provide to clients are governed by a separate written agreement, which takes priority over anything on this website.</p>
      <h2>Information on this site</h2>
      <p>We aim to keep information accurate and up to date, but it is general information and not professional, legal or regulatory advice. Prices and service descriptions are confirmed in a written quote before any work begins.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The content and design of this website belong to {company.legalName} or are used with permission. You may view and share pages for personal or business reference, but not copy them for commercial use without permission.</p>
      <h2>Links</h2>
      <p>Links to other websites are provided for convenience. We are not responsible for their content.</p>
      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>We are not liable for any loss arising from use of this website, except where the law does not allow us to exclude liability.</p>
      <h2 id="website-199">Website from £{W.setup}: order terms (version {W.termsVersion})</h2>
      <p>These terms apply when you order the "Website from £{W.setup}" online or in writing. The contract is between you and {company.legalName}, company number {company.companyNumber}, {company.address}.</p>
      <h3>1. Business customers only</h3>
      <p>This offer is for businesses, including sole traders, buying for their trade, business or profession. By ordering you confirm you are not buying as a consumer.</p>
      <h3>2. What is included</h3>
      <p>One web page with up to six sections built on our professional template; contact form connected to our CRM; click-to-call and WhatsApp buttons; basic on-page SEO, sitemap and Google Search Console set-up; cookie banner and privacy notices; one round of changes before launch; and connecting the website to your domain and hosting. Domain registration and hosting are not included in the build fee. If you want us to provide them, we agree the price with you separately in writing before the website goes live. Extras, such as more pages, copywriting or a logo, are charged only if you order them.</p>
      <h3>3. Price and payment</h3>
      <p>The build fee of £{W.setup} is a one-off payment made in advance when you order. There is no monthly fee and no subscription for the website build. {company.legalName} is not VAT registered, so no VAT is charged. If we register for VAT, we will tell you at least 30 days before VAT is added.</p>
      <h3>4. Domain and hosting</h3>
      <p>If we agree to register a domain or host the website for you, the price, term and any renewal are set out in that separate agreement. If you use your own domain or hosting, you are responsible for keeping them active.</p>
      <h3>5. Delivery</h3>
      <p>We aim to publish your website within {W.days} working days of receiving the build payment and all your materials (logo, text and photos, or your completed brief). Delays in sending materials or approving the preview move the date.</p>
      <h3>6. Your materials</h3>
      <p>You confirm you have the right to use the logos, text, photos and other content you send us, and that it is accurate and lawful.</p>
      <h3>7. Ownership</h3>
      <p>Your domain and your content belong to you. Once the build fee is paid, you may use the finished website for your business. Our underlying template, code and systems remain ours. If you host the website elsewhere, we give you a copy of the website files and your content.</p>
      <h3>8. Refunds</h3>
      <p>If we cannot deliver your website, we refund the build fee in full. Once we have started building, the build fee is not refundable.</p>
      <h3>9. Missed payments</h3>
      <p>We start work once the build fee is paid. Payments for any domain or hosting you agree with us are covered by that separate agreement.</p>
      <h3>10. Liability</h3>
      <p>Our total liability under this contract is limited to the fees you paid in the 12 months before the claim. We are not liable for loss of profit, business or data. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>
      <h3>11. Law</h3>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales, and the courts of England and Wales have jurisdiction.</p>
      <h2>Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
